<para><computeroutput>__winbinderEventHandler ( $window,  $id,  $ctrl,  $param1,  $param2)</computeroutput></para>
<para>Event handler for <link linkend="_class_win_binder">WinBinder</link> events.</para>

<para>This function is called by <link linkend="_class_win_binder">WinBinder</link> when an event occurs. It retrieves the callback associated with the window and executes it. If a timer is associated with the callback, the timer is destroyed before executing the callback.</para>

